      "message": "I don\u0027t know much about this module, nor am I much of a DKMS guru. I just figured I\u0027d patch this when I saw the failure.\n\nI expect I probably don\u0027t actually rely on the module any more, so I\u0027m just removing it from my system, and I\u0027ll see what breaks. I rarely even use servod at all these days.",
      "parentUuid": "a00f9150_7b2c718a",
      "revId": "e2d2dca9f35d881481645d67939a395caf29b496",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
